  "summary": "CI上のAgent workflowは、GITHUB_TOKENをcontents:read既定、pull_request_target/workflow_runでのfork checkoutを避け、untrusted入力はenv経由、environment protectionでsecret注入前に承認、first-time contributor gate、action SHA pin、Agentのtool allowlist最小化、Agent版を修正済み以上に固定する",
  "remedy_type": "harness",
  "maturity": "official",
  "status": "active",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "kind": "official-guidance",
      "reference": "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/secure-use",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-15",
      "summary": "GITHUB_TOKEN read-only既定、pull_request_target/workflow_runでのfork checkout回避、untrusted inputはenv経由、環境保護でsecretに承認、full SHA pinのみ不変、OIDC推奨。AI agent固有記述なし",
      "quality": "high"
    },
    {
      "kind": "postmortem",
      "reference": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/06/05/securing-ci-cd-in-agentic-world-claude-code-github-action-case/",
      "observed_at": "2026-06-05",
      "summary": "Comment-and-Control系: PR title/issue body/commentからのinjectionでsecret読出し。修正2.1.128（2026-05-05）。緩和: Rule of Two、key per workflow、tool allowlist、system prompt hardening、token監視・rotation",
      "quality": "high"
    },
    {
      "kind": "field-report",
      "reference": "https://labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org/research/csa-research-note-comment-control-github-prompt-injection-20/",
      "observed_at": "2026-04-15",
      "summary": "Claude Code Security Review/Gemini CLI Action/Copilot Agentが同一手法で乗っ取り可能と開示、hardened Actions設定（permissions、environment protection、first-time contributor gate）で遮断",
      "quality": "medium"
    },
    {
      "kind": "official-guidance",
      "reference": "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/security",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-15",
      "summary": "-p headlessではtrust verification無効、network commandは既定非自動許可",
      "quality": "high"
